    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28357" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δραχμ-ιαῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>worth</i> or <i>costing a drachma,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				425
			</span></i>; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίδειξις</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				384b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. συναλλάγματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1300b33
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τόκος</span> interest <i>at
				the rate of 1 dr. per 100 denarii per month,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IGRom.
				4.788
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Apamea</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1038.20
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>weighing one drachm,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.876
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
